WEBVTT

00:14:58.168 --> 00:15:00.413
and I can't be creative
because you exist,"

00:15:00.437 --> 00:15:04.041
but rather, to say, "You are part
of the family of my consciousness.

00:15:04.065 --> 00:15:06.242
You are one of the emotions
that I possess.

00:15:06.266 --> 00:15:09.369
And I hear your complaint,
and I see your anxiety,

00:15:09.393 --> 00:15:11.541
and I see everything
you're putting before me

00:15:11.565 --> 00:15:14.312
about how this will be a disaster,
how I'm going to die,

00:15:14.336 --> 00:15:16.706
how everybody will mock me,
how I'm going to fail,

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.881
and I thank you so much
for your contribution.

00:15:18.905 --> 00:15:22.528
However, your sister creativity and I
are going to go off on this journey now

00:15:22.552 --> 00:15:25.154
and do this thing, but you're
allowed to be in the car.

00:15:25.178 --> 00:15:28.182
We're going on a road trip,
but I don't expect you to not come."

00:15:28.206 --> 00:15:30.213
And once you allow fear
to just be present,